<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Neptunis cannot explain share rise.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Neptunis cannot explain share rise.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A trading halt has been lifted on the shares of Neptunis International Holdings Ltd, the ASX said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In response to a price query, Neptunis said there were no matters of importance about to be announced and it was not aware of any material information which might explain recent trading.</p>
<p>Neptunis shares closed on Monday at 31 cents, up from 22.5 cents on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
